  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Slums Upgrading and Integrated Urban Development Project in Boulaos</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed development objective is to contribute towards achieving the National Development Strategy to upgrade slum neighborhoods and improving the living conditions of the population. The specific objectives are: (i) upgrade the physical infrastructure of the neighborhoods and improve the living conditions for slum dwellers, (ii) strengthen the capacity of public institutions in charge of implementing of Zero Slum Program, and (iii) economic empowerment of beneficiaries through enhancing access to line of finance.</narrative>
  </description>
